  message: "Implemented in commit 2e66008 on branch jgstern-agent/feat/event-sourcing-linker-expansion. auto-pr in flight. Adds Guava EventBus (bus.post/@Subscribe), generic Java event bus (fire/dispatch/register/addListener), Go channel events (ch<-/\\<-ch), Go event bus (Publish/Subscribe/Emit/On). 13 new tests, 100% coverage."  # 4558
